Vikram and Betal: The Three Friends

King Vikram was once again carrying Betal through the forest.

Betal began another story.

“Three friends set out on a journey,” said Betal. “One was very intelligent, one was very brave, and one was very kind.”

During their journey, they found a man lying unconscious in the forest.

The intelligent friend said, “I know how to bring him back to life.”

The brave friend said, “I will protect us from danger while you do it.”

The kind friend said, “I will take care of him once he wakes up.”

Together, they helped the man and saved his life.

Later, the man became rich and wanted to reward one of them.

But he was confused. “Who deserves the reward the most?” he asked.

Betal then asked Vikram, “Who should be rewarded?”

Vikram replied, “All three should be rewarded equally because each one played an important role.”

Betal laughed and said, “Correct answer, Vikram!”

But as Vikram spoke, Betal flew back to the tree again.

💖 Moral:

Teamwork makes success possible.
